        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Field Between is a psychological horror farming simulator, manage your very own farm, buying crops, planting them, watching them grow, and selling them off to your customers, all the while expanding your farm and improving your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day, customers will arrive to your farm, looking for specific orders, complete these to earn money, which you can spend on new crops, fertilisers, upgrading your farm, or upgrading your tools to improve your progress and earn more money. The better you do, the higher your reputation will rise, getting you better offers from customers and earning you even more money, slowly build your farming empire up from the humble patch of grass you started with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure to deal with all your customers before night falls, as any remaining will become agitated and offer you reduced rewards, then use your remaining time to clean and set up for the next day. When you're ready, head to bed and get some well deserved sleep, just try not to have any dreams...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Customise your farm</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a wide range of crops, allowing you to customise your farm however you want and better tailor your style of play. Want to be constantly on the go, travelling back and forth between handling customers and handling your plants? Then there's plenty of fast-growing plants that will benefit such a playstyle. Or would you rather a more relaxed experience, watching your crops grow and taking in the sun? Then there's also options for you. You can also pick from a variety of fertilisers, each having different benefits to enhance your farming experience, find what you like best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962310/extras/73af8aeba65c382edf9dd25a25906b27.poster.avif?t=1775239352\" aria-label=\"Showcasing all the plants and fertilisers in the store\" width=1024 height=572 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962310/extras/73af8aeba65c382edf9dd25a25906b27.webm?t=1775239352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962310/extras/73af8aeba65c382edf9dd25a25906b27.mp4?t=1775239352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Keep your customers happy</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers will regularly visit your farm with specific requests, which you can either accept or reject. Delivering customer orders is the fastest way to make money, but make sure not to take on too many and overburden yourself. You only have so much time in your day, and customers with orders you've accepted will get increasingly agitated the longer they're forced to wait. Keeping your customers happy is important, as satisfied customers will increase your reputation, which will increase the amount of customers you get, and improve their offers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962310/extras/4b0821e2c5ca29f25afc3ab576a89fa9.poster.avif?t=1775239352\" aria-label=\"Talking with a customer and delivering their order\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962310/extras/4b0821e2c5ca29f25afc3ab576a89fa9.webm?t=1775239352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962310/extras/4b0821e2c5ca29f25afc3ab576a89fa9.mp4?t=1775239352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Experience an evolving environment</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your farm isn't just a static background, it is constantly changing with different weather and day events, keeping it from feeling the same across your playthrough. Don't expect these events to just be limited to weather however, there's plenty of dark secrets for you to discover as you try your best to manage your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962310/extras/da4f76be956350e267b1ff3e080d59e8.poster.avif?t=1775239352\" aria-label=\"Showcasing the different environments, day, cold morning, rain, evening, night\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962310/extras/da4f76be956350e267b1ff3e080d59e8.webm?t=1775239352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962310/extras/da4f76be956350e267b1ff3e080d59e8.mp4?t=1775239352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Unlock multiple endings</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With up to five unique endings and plenty of secrets to discover, you can playthrough the game multiple times and still have a fresh experience. As well, each ending unlocks game-altering features, allowing you to further customise your experience and aiding you on your journey to 100%.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962310/extras/3ef864e39b8924a10cda4fb050f691de.poster.avif?t=1775239352\" aria-label=\"First person perspective going to bed\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962310/extras/3ef864e39b8924a10cda4fb050f691de.webm?t=1775239352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
