ideo/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Experience an evolving environment</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your farm isn't just a static background, it is constantly changing with different weather and day events, keeping it from feeling the same across your playthrough. Don't expect these events to just be limited to weather however, there's plenty of dark secrets for you to discover as you try your best to manage your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962310/extras/da4f76be956350e267b1ff3e080d59e8.poster.avif?t=1775239352\" aria-label=\"Showcasing the different environments, day, cold morning, rain, evening, night\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962310/extras/da4f76be956350e267b1ff3e080d59e8.webm?t=1775239352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962310/extras/da4f76be956350e267b1ff3e080d59e8.mp4?t=1775239352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Unlock multiple endings</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With up to five unique endings and plenty of secrets to discover, you can playthrough the game multiple times and still have a fresh experience. As well, each ending unlocks game-altering features, allowing you to further customise your experience and aiding you on your journey to 100%.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962310/extras/3ef864e39b8924a10cda4fb050f691de.poster.avif?t=1775239352\" aria-label=\"First person perspective going to